  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'At Menace Labs you will be given charge of a clone. This clone will be
    allocated a long term goal that will have to be reached within its lifespan of
    6 days. Upon completion of the goal, the clone will be freed to live out the
    remainder of its days as a successful clone. The Menace Director will be monitoring
    the clone''s performance and stress levels so it can adjust the environment and
    send the clone for tests to ensure true success.


    You will be able to direct
    the clone by clicking on some objects in its quarters. Aim to keep its needs
    high and improve its skills as quickly as possible as these will have an impact
    on both the Director''s actions and the success of any tests the clone is sent
    to.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 574d97029a3bdc74bbb5710fc0e44eb6, type: 2}
